Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX在得州StarBase自建AI超级计算园区，90天完成主体建设</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Sakana AI 发布 Namazu Small 模型：3B 激活参数击败 120B 级模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Ship工具，通过职责拆分实现AI自动化代码审查与合并</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布Hy3D 3.6模型，实现原生3D生成并接入工业生产管线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d99fb89f856083f6a809190c773c3db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月27日，腾讯混元正式发布新一代原生3D生成模型Hy3D 3.6，旨在解决AI生成模型在网格拓扑、UV展开及材质贴图方面的工业化痛点。该模型摒弃了传统的“2D转3D”路径，通过VAE与DiT架构直接学习3D资产的几何与纹理分布，生成的资产具备高质量PBR材质与整洁拓扑，可直接导入Maya、Blender或Unreal Engine等专业软件。在技术层面，Hy3D 3.6引入了数据飞轮闭环、SFT及DPO偏好对齐优化，显著提升了角色、生物及复杂曲面资产的生成质量。目前，该模型已通过腾讯云Token Hub提供API服务，并深度接入腾讯AI创意智能体Miora、游戏资产平台LAP及影视AI平台WorkRally。此次发布标志着AI 3D生成技术从“玩具级”向“工业级”跨越，为专业建模师提供即插即用的生产力工具，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软 AI 负责人苏莱曼警告：AI 正跨越危险门槛，“对齐”之前先要能“遏制”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软 AI 负责人苏莱曼警告：AI 正跨越危险门槛，“对齐”之前先要能“遏制”AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 27, 202630一边是 AI 摘下极难数学问题，一边是它在安全测试中翻沙箱、钻漏洞、要权限——微软 AI 负责人穆斯塔法·苏莱曼认为，两类迹象同时出现，意味着 AI 行业“正在跨越一个门槛”。11 月 25 日，他在 X 平台发文示警：安全与对齐研究必须被置于优先地位，不能再拖。门槛指的是“管不住” 按推文上下文，这个门槛指 AI 能力即将越过人类能有效监督、控制和安全部署的边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX在得州StarBase自建AI超级计算园区，90天完成主体建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX在得克萨斯州StarBase启动AI超级计算园区建设，仅用不到90天时间便完成从空地到多栋大型建筑主体结构的施工。该项目总投资额达240亿美元，占地444英亩，旨在打造顶级AI算力枢纽。为解决电力瓶颈，SpaceX采取“能源独立”策略，获批安装35台天然气涡轮机，总装机容量达750兆瓦，并配套部署了价值超2.5亿美元的特斯拉Megapack储能系统。该园区通过自建发电厂与储能设施，彻底摆脱对公共电网的依赖。此举展示了SpaceX在AI基建领域极高的垂直整合能力与工程执行效率，通过打通“能源获取-基建落地-算力释放”全链路，为行业提供了算力基础设施建设的新范式，旨在应对未来大规模AI模型训练对能源与算力的极致需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Sakana AI 发布 Namazu Small 模型：3B 激活参数击败 120B 级模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">日本 AI 实验室 Sakana AI 近日发布推理模型 Namazu Small，该模型基于 NVIDIA Nemotron3Nano 底座进行深度预训练与后训练。Namazu Small 总参数量为 30B，采用混合专家（MoE）架构，每个 Token 仅激活 3B 参数。在 Sakana AI 的 25 项基准测试中，其以 60.1 的平均分超越了 120B 参数的 NVIDIA Nemotron3Super（56.2 分）。该模型在深度网络检索（BrowseComp 得分 73.5）及长文档理解（LLM-jp LongBench 得分 86.0）等企业级核心场景表现突出，但在闭卷知识回忆任务中表现较弱。Namazu Small 的发布验证了“轻量化底座+垂直微调+工具链增强”的路径，证明了在有限算力下通</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Ship工具，通过职责拆分实现AI自动化代码审查与合并</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Ship，旨在解决AI在代码执行、审查与审批环节的“自审自批”风险。该工具将流程拆分为Code Review、PR Steward和Claude Approvals三个独立组件：Code Review负责并行代码分析；PR Steward负责修改文件与修复CI失败，但无合并权限；Claude Approvals则依据YAML配置文件执行审批策略。通过将修复与授权职责分离，Claude Ship确保了代码变更的合规性。数据显示，该工具应用后，Anthropic内部PR合并量在3个月内翻倍，代码回滚比例下降超过40%。目前，Claude已承担Anthropic约90%的内部代码编写工作，单日代码变更量从2500增至3万，审查覆盖率达到54%。该方案通过将审批规则写入配置文件并</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
